	•	Section 2 Comments/Quotes: The analytic cohorts comprised 81,327 eligible UNOS recipients, 3,061 Eurotransplant recipients, 1,546 Scandiatransplant recipients, and 14 External-CN recipients, totalling 85,948. The UNOS cohort was divided into derivation (n=45,927), temporal test (n=20,200), and out-of-time validation (n=15,200) cohorts. Age and female sex were reported separately by UNOS era rather than as pooled overall values. Race and extensive donor-recipient clinical characteristics were reported, including diagnoses, prior surgery and transplantation, mechanical support, dialysis, donor hypertension and diabetes, creatinine, and ischemic time.

